(6989044, 1055449, 10785, '<td valign="top">The studio lighting here is perfect, along with the exposure. No bad highlights or reflections to speak of. The white bowl really blends in too much with the background. The shadows are almost non-existent and the bowl really loses it''s definition and shape. I think a red background would have been very a real great choice for this shot. But the technique is great for the white on white challenge coming up!</td>', 'The studio lighting here is perfect, along with the exposure. No bad highlights or reflections to speak of. The white bowl really blends in too much with the background. The shadows are almost non-existent and the bowl really loses it''s definition and shape. I think a red background would have been very a real great choice for this shot. But the technique is great for the white on white challenge coming up!', '2013-03-01 19:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
