(6989379, 1054696, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wonderful compositional triangle! Your bum must be wet as your footprints have been washed away :) There could be more in post processing, perhaps some extra contrast and saturation, however the image as such conveys a perfect photographic rule. 7.</td>', 'Wonderful compositional triangle! Your bum must be wet as your footprints have been washed away :) There could be more in post processing, perhaps some extra contrast and saturation, however the image as such conveys a perfect photographic rule. 7.', '2013-03-02 09:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
