(6989389, 1055684, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love it.  Great catch and great catch.  10<br/> <br/>Pied Kingfisher (<i>Ceryle rudis</i>).  This is a male, as indicated by the double band across the chest.  Widely distributed across Africa and Asia.    But, I''ll guess sub-Saharan Africa for this fine specimen.</td>', 'Wow!  Love it.  Great catch and great catch.  10 Pied Kingfisher (Ceryle rudis).  This is a male, as indicated by the double band across the chest.  Widely distributed across Africa and Asia.    But, I''ll guess sub-Saharan Africa for this fine specimen.', '2013-03-02 09:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989390, 1055795, 54446, '<td valign="top">Hard to find Colorado snow in February.  Good luck!</td>', 'Hard to find Colorado snow in February.  Good luck!', '2013-03-02 09:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989433, 1054696, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very lovely composition! Love the soft light and tones. Only thing I''m not sure about is the object to the right of the person. I find it keeps drawing my eye away from the boat and the person.</td>', 'Very lovely composition! Love the soft light and tones. Only thing I''m not sure about is the object to the right of the person. I find it keeps drawing my eye away from the boat and the person.', '2013-03-02 11:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989434, 1055865, 124982, '<td valign="top">Refreshing to see a portrait that hasn''t been processed to the moon and back. Beautiful restrain, and lovely image!</td>', 'Refreshing to see a portrait that hasn''t been processed to the moon and back. Beautiful restrain, and lovely image!', '2013-03-02 11:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989435, 1053196, 124982, '<td valign="top">Oh my. I do like this image A LOT. Splendid lighting and magnificent detail. Quite gorgeous, really.</td>', 'Oh my. I do like this image A LOT. Splendid lighting and magnificent detail. Quite gorgeous, really.', '2013-03-02 11:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989436, 1054623, 124982, '<td valign="top">Had a lot of potential this image, but the processing has ruined it. Lots of artifacts and halos.</td>', 'Had a lot of potential this image, but the processing has ruined it. Lots of artifacts and halos.', '2013-03-02 11:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989437, 1056009, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, and great capture. Perhaps a tighter crop on the head would''ve provided a lot more punch!</td>', 'Nice detail, and great capture. Perhaps a tighter crop on the head would''ve provided a lot more punch!', '2013-03-02 11:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989438, 1056012, 124982, '<td valign="top">Sempermarine of Arabia?</td>', 'Sempermarine of Arabia?', '2013-03-02 11:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989439, 1055497, 124982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture and processing (and model). Lovely "high-key" B&amp;W. I wonder if the eyes were open, just how much more effect this would''ve give the image?</td>', 'Beautiful capture and processing (and model). Lovely "high-key" B&W. I wonder if the eyes were open, just how much more effect this would''ve give the image?', '2013-03-02 11:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989441, 1055752, 124982, '<td valign="top">Took me a few seconds to figure out what it was! Very nice capture! Could use a little more contrast to boost the blacks and whites as it seems very uniformly "grey". A little more tonal range and wowza, this would''ve been lovely!</td>', 'Took me a few seconds to figure out what it was! Very nice capture! Could use a little more contrast to boost the blacks and whites as it seems very uniformly "grey". A little more tonal range and wowza, this would''ve been lovely!', '2013-03-02 11:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989443, 1054711, 124982, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, and the processing is spectacular. Would love to know how you processed this image...looks like HDR converted to B&amp;W?</td>', 'Love the composition, and the processing is spectacular. Would love to know how you processed this image...looks like HDR converted to B&W?', '2013-03-02 11:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6989445, 1053871, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely long exposure!</td>', 'Lovely long exposure!', '2013-03-02 11:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
