(6989544, 1053460, 108580, '<td valign="top">Pertinent image. Perfect lighting and lightning. Could be Rian although the death took place at the coast. Tragic. Including the 140,000+ deaths on South African roads every year due to reckless and arrogant driving. <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_countries_by_traffic-related_death_rate" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">We are #24 in the world by deaths per 100,000</a>. There is not a large margin of numbers between us and #1. No one stops any more at lights, stop streets, at pedestrian crossings, at schools and crèches.</td>', 'Pertinent image. Perfect lighting and lightning. Could be Rian although the death took place at the coast. Tragic. Including the 140,000+ deaths on South African roads every year due to reckless and arrogant driving. We are #24 in the world by deaths per 100,000. There is not a large margin of numbers between us and #1. No one stops any more at lights, stop streets, at pedestrian crossings, at schools and crèches.', '2013-03-02 14:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
