(6989749, 1054711, 82999, '<td valign="top">This is quite remarkable.  Currently my pic to win.  I''m a bit torn though because I''m not sure the blur on the women is necessary.  Find it distracting.  It''s the reflection in the mirror that drives the image for me.  The softness in the image really emphasizes the mystery as well.  Really nice work.</td>', 'This is quite remarkable.  Currently my pic to win.  I''m a bit torn though because I''m not sure the blur on the women is necessary.  Find it distracting.  It''s the reflection in the mirror that drives the image for me.  The softness in the image really emphasizes the mystery as well.  Really nice work.', '2013-03-02 21:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
