(6989822, 1054488, 108580, '<td valign="top">My kinda place :) They are the funniest animals, always cantering and chasing one another and then suddenly a burst of group activity. The slight desaturation/blueishness (distant background) is unusual in your processing and I''m finding that to be less unreal as I once did. I like the shot but in all honesty it would be more powerful if they were headed to ward me, as difficult as that is to ever capture.</td>', 'My kinda place :) They are the funniest animals, always cantering and chasing one another and then suddenly a burst of group activity. The slight desaturation/blueishness (distant background) is unusual in your processing and I''m finding that to be less unreal as I once did. I like the shot but in all honesty it would be more powerful if they were headed to ward me, as difficult as that is to ever capture.', '2013-03-02 23:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
