(6991619, 1054488, 138630, '<td valign="top">An incredible wildlife capture, one most of us will never witness except in a capture such as this or on TV.  Part of me wishes they were coming toward me - part of me is very glad you weren''t in their path LOL  Nicely done.  10  Voted earlier.</td>', 'An incredible wildlife capture, one most of us will never witness except in a capture such as this or on TV.  Part of me wishes they were coming toward me - part of me is very glad you weren''t in their path LOL  Nicely done.  10  Voted earlier.', '2013-03-04 23:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991621, 1055459, 108544, '<td valign="top">I really like the image you two made. From the quality and angle of lighting you chose. Too the effort of the young singer. Great job. Being picky,  I wonder if the visible flash, would have been better, hidden behind the mic. I just find it slightly distracting. Although, I do like the flare it creates. mmmm....<br/> <br/>But yeah, nice job guys!</td>', 'I really like the image you two made. From the quality and angle of lighting you chose. Too the effort of the young singer. Great job. Being picky,  I wonder if the visible flash, would have been better, hidden behind the mic. I just find it slightly distracting. Although, I do like the flare it creates. mmmm.... But yeah, nice job guys!', '2013-03-04 23:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991624, 1052720, 138630, '<td valign="top">Can''t say why I like this so well, but I do.  Love the hunched over figure with his face hidden by the huge bouquets - there''s a story here - and especially like the composition choices you made.  The different rectangles and squares with the strong vertical and horizontal lines fit together like a well crafted jigsaw puzzle.  9  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Can''t say why I like this so well, but I do.  Love the hunched over figure with his face hidden by the huge bouquets - there''s a story here - and especially like the composition choices you made.  The different rectangles and squares with the strong vertical and horizontal lines fit together like a well crafted jigsaw puzzle.  9  Voted earlier.', '2013-03-04 23:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991625, 1056008, 138630, '<td valign="top">Such a quiet scene but so well seen and captured.  Certainly speaks to the depths of winter.  Love the soft flowing lines of the mounds and drifts of snow.  Title made me smile.  9  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Such a quiet scene but so well seen and captured.  Certainly speaks to the depths of winter.  Love the soft flowing lines of the mounds and drifts of snow.  Title made me smile.  9  Voted earlier.', '2013-03-04 23:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
