(6991642, 1055561, 108544, '<td valign="top">The longer I look, the more I like. So much interesting body laugauge going on. <br/>It is really cool to see, the emotions going through each person. The focus, apprehension, joy and confusion to name a few, really add to the image. Add in the stereo typical scenario and you have that much more interest. I personally think it is very tasteful and tells so many interesting/positive stories. I still want to know what that big guy laughing, said to the ref!<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'The longer I look, the more I like. So much interesting body laugauge going on. It is really cool to see, the emotions going through each person. The focus, apprehension, joy and confusion to name a few, really add to the image. Add in the stereo typical scenario and you have that much more interest. I personally think it is very tasteful and tells so many interesting/positive stories. I still want to know what that big guy laughing, said to the ref! Well done!', '2013-03-04 23:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
