(6992280, 1054835, 108580, '<td valign="top">Love these buildings, expansive, voluminous and bygone. 7.</td>', 'Love these buildings, expansive, voluminous and bygone. 7.', '2013-03-05 16:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6992281, 1053871, 108580, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell this one apart from a number of DPC''ers. I have my guesses though. Beautiful (DPC) eye candy through masterful photography and camera skills to PP wizardry. Top Ten. 8</td>', 'It''s hard to tell this one apart from a number of DPC''ers. I have my guesses though. Beautiful (DPC) eye candy through masterful photography and camera skills to PP wizardry. Top Ten. 8', '2013-03-05 16:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6992282, 1052517, 108580, '<td valign="top">Photography at it''s best. 8</td>', 'Photography at it''s best. 8', '2013-03-05 16:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6992286, 1055479, 108580, '<td valign="top">In this FS there are a number of ''African'' images and they stir an emotion in me that cannot easily be described. To the rest of the world Africa is the dark and sad 3rd world continent with fly encrusted starving faces. Yet this image portrays something different. A look of wariness and a face half hidden by the arm speaking volumes of how poorly children are treated here by adults, mostly parents, largely by self serving politicians. A dark background hides a room filled with fear, in-trepidation and secrets. An emotive 8.</td>', 'In this FS there are a number of ''African'' images and they stir an emotion in me that cannot easily be described. To the rest of the world Africa is the dark and sad 3rd world continent with fly encrusted starving faces. Yet this image portrays something different. A look of wariness and a face half hidden by the arm speaking volumes of how poorly children are treated here by adults, mostly parents, largely by self serving politicians. A dark background hides a room filled with fear, in-trepidation and secrets. An emotive 8.', '2013-03-05 16:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
