(6992335, 1055619, 104230, '<td valign="top">Fascinating.  Lovely initial impact and it rewards a longer look as well. It''s interesting how well the flat light works in this image.  Just enough detail in the foreground trees against a backdrop of shapes and patterns.  It reminds me of some artist''s work, but I cannot retrieve the artist''s name...</td>', 'Fascinating.  Lovely initial impact and it rewards a longer look as well. It''s interesting how well the flat light works in this image.  Just enough detail in the foreground trees against a backdrop of shapes and patterns.  It reminds me of some artist''s work, but I cannot retrieve the artist''s name...', '2013-03-05 17:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
