(6992417, 1055769, 116247, '<td valign="top">At first I saw the girl in the front row looking to the side and thought the title was talking about her. Then I saw the girl in the second row on the right and thought ohhhh maybe it''s her. Then I spotted the girl in the upper left who is not singing and looks like she has a bit of stage fright and realize the title could be about any one of the girls in the picture. What a great moment you captured.</td>', 'At first I saw the girl in the front row looking to the side and thought the title was talking about her. Then I saw the girl in the second row on the right and thought ohhhh maybe it''s her. Then I spotted the girl in the upper left who is not singing and looks like she has a bit of stage fright and realize the title could be about any one of the girls in the picture. What a great moment you captured.', '2013-03-05 20:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
