(6995139, 1055096, 116807, '<td valign="top">I took this photo in the patio of a French Quarter bar. The stairs led to apartments above no longer occupied.  In post-processing, I used Corel Paintshop Pro X5 and Topaz plugins. Somehow I forgot to include the title "Seen Better Days".<br/>I don''t know why holes were in the bottom steps.  I hope to visit again to find out.<br/>Thank you for taking the time to make comments.</td>', 'I took this photo in the patio of a French Quarter bar. The stairs led to apartments above no longer occupied.  In post-processing, I used Corel Paintshop Pro X5 and Topaz plugins. Somehow I forgot to include the title "Seen Better Days".I don''t know why holes were in the bottom steps.  I hope to visit again to find out.Thank you for taking the time to make comments.', '2013-03-08 08:49:19.000000', NULL, 0),
