(6995185, 1055154, 12611, '<td valign="top">I used to flip lazily around the television channels in my youth on Saturdays. Once in a while I would come upon a B grade movie about some European Satanist sex/death cult that had its headquarters in some swanky gentrified country mansion in the upper midlands of England, or perhaps Normandy- somewhere nondescript and rural. I imagine this place to be located on the grounds of this mansion. Haunting was a good description as well.</td>', 'I used to flip lazily around the television channels in my youth on Saturdays. Once in a while I would come upon a B grade movie about some European Satanist sex/death cult that had its headquarters in some swanky gentrified country mansion in the upper midlands of England, or perhaps Normandy- somewhere nondescript and rural. I imagine this place to be located on the grounds of this mansion. Haunting was a good description as well.', '2013-03-08 09:43:52.000000', NULL, 0),
