(6995786, 1055935, 124190, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  :-) We didn''t get many of these my way this winter....shame...... hey my entry got d.q''d I messed up on the date somehow..... but I''m mentioning it to several photogs whose work I enjoy and thought you''d like it.....maybe not.....of course it''s below the end of the page of the freestudy results.<br/></td>', 'Very cool.  :-) We didn''t get many of these my way this winter....shame...... hey my entry got d.q''d I messed up on the date somehow..... but I''m mentioning it to several photogs whose work I enjoy and thought you''d like it.....maybe not.....of course it''s below the end of the page of the freestudy results.', '2013-03-09 07:47:06.000000', NULL, 0),
